# Copied to dist/ by Vite, then read by wrangler: every pattern here is excluded
# from the static-asset upload (and .assetsignore itself is never uploaded).
#
# Why this file exists: public/ is served verbatim at the site root, so
# public/README.md — an internal note about the missing og.png — would otherwise
# be live at https://gtmxagents.com/README.md. Keeping the note next to the
# assets it documents is worth more than the one line it costs to not ship it.
README.md
